</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid pt-4 mt-none pt-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Architecture/Design </strong></p>
<p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/miallarchitecture/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Miall Architecture</a> / <a href="https://aardesign.com.au/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">AAR design and Drafting</a></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Color</strong></p>
<p>Marmorio </p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Thickness</strong></p>
<p>12 mm</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>End date</strong></p>
<p>2025</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" ></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The light stripe structure and filled pores of Dekton Marmorio are inspired by Navona travertine, a natural stone quarried near Tivoli, east of Rome. This aesthetic was precisely what Miall Architecture was looking for in a house in Williamstown, a historic coastal neighbourhood located southwest of Melbourne's centre. “I wanted to use travertine throughout the project, but we needed a very durable and practical material for a family home. Dekton allowed us to achieve the look of natural stone without its drawbacks,” the studio recalls.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133164-1768305846]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-1-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Williamtown (1)" title="Williamtown (1)" /></a></li>
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-9.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133164-1768305846]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-9-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Williamtown (9)" title="Williamtown (9)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-10.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1649&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133164-426054662]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-10-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Williamtown (10)" title="Williamtown (10)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-12.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1649&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133164-2882961589]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-12-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Williamtown (12)" title="Williamtown (12)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">Functionality and aesthetics thanks to Dekton</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Compared to travertine, a limestone sensitive to acidic substances, Dekton features almost zero porosity and high resistance to all types of stains, scratches, and high temperatures. This makes daily maintenance easier (a damp cloth is enough to clean it) and allows it to be used in areas exposed to spills, humidity, and intensive use with maximum hygiene and without the care required by natural stone.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>“Its durability allowed us to use it uniformly on both indoor and outdoor worktops. Additionally, the thin large-format panels provided an effective solution for wall cladding,” say Miall Architecture.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Dekton Marmorio is indeed applied to all types of surfaces in this cosy and contemporary Australian home, from splashbacks and worktops to the barbecue area, fireplace, and guest toilet, a space much loved by the interior designers. “With its walls clad in Dekton, it is the most prominent space in the home. The material brings a natural warmth that makes the room feel a little more special.”</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-11.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133164-2229294793]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-11-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Williamtown (11)" title="Williamtown (11)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-14.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1649&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133164-212750034]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Williamtown-14-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Williamtown (14)" title="Williamtown (14)" /></a></li>
