<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="2000" height="1333" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Chengal-Screen-House-by-Supernormal-10-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="Image 31 of Chengal Screen House by Supernormal 10 1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in The beauty of travertine with Dekton Marmorio brings continuity to this elegant home - Cosentino" title="Chengal-Screen-House-by-Supernormal-(10)"></div>
</figure></div>
</p></div>
<div class="item-card-body">
<h3 class="card-body-title">Dekton Entzo brings lightness and continuity to a very special Malaysian home</h3>
<p class="card-body-tags">Dekton, Kitchens, Floors</p>
</p></div>
<p>                    </a>
                </div>
</p></div>
<div class="col-12 d-md-none d-block text-center section-button">
            <a href="" class="mb-0 btn btn-primary" gtm-label="_2"></a>        </div>
</p></div>
