			</item>
		<item>
		<title>{{Three Dekton colours for a sober, modern and balanced façade}}</title>
		<link>https://www.cosentino.com/usa/blog/three-dekton-colours-for-a-sober-modern-and-balanced-facade/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[sarabarragan]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:35:31 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[{{Blog & Events}}]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Cladding]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Dekton]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Facade]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cosentino.com/usa/blog/three-dekton-colours-for-a-sober-modern-and-balanced-facade/</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Known for its elegant boutiques, shopping malls, and gourmet restaurants, Bağdat Caddesi stands out as one of Istanbul's most exclusive areas. For this reason, the avenue is increasingly populated with luxury buildings such as Prenses Palas, recently constructed. But how to differentiate them from the rest? For Gülseren Nur Özçakir from Reneva Group and Can Kuskon 3DStudios, the answer was clear: focusing on a solid, harmonious, and modern presence.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="2000" height="1334" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image wp-post-image" alt="Image 48 of Prenses Palas 1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in {{Three Dekton colours for a sober, modern and balanced façade}} - Cosentino" style="margin-bottom:20px;max-width:100%;height:auto" title="Image of Prenses Palas 1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 - Cosentino"></p>
<div class="wpb-content-wrapper">
<section style="position: relative; background:#ffffff" data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section vc_custom_1596523778098 cos-section">
<div class='cos-cut-background cos-cut-height-11-12' style='background-color: #d9dedf'></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper "></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-l">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p class="mb-4">Case Study</p>
<h1><strong>Three Dekton colors for a restrained, modern, and balanced façade</strong></h1>
<p>Gülseren Nur Özçakır – Reneva Group, Can Kuskon 3DStudios</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center">
<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-1-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Prenses Palas (1)" title="Prenses Palas (1)" /></div>
</figure></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section mt-xl mb-xl">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-none pb-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Location</strong></p>
<p>Kadıköy, Istanbul (Turkey)</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Material </strong></p>
<p>Dekton </p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Aplication</strong></p>
<p>Ventilated façade (DKC), balcony ceiling cladding</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Quantity</strong></p>
<p>1,225 slabs</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Photography</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://erbilbalta.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Erbil Balta</a></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid pt-4 mt-none pt-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Architecture/Design </strong></p>
<p><a href="https://gulserennurozcakir.com.tr/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Gülseren Nur Özçakır</a> – <a href="https://www.renevagroup.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Reneva Group</a>, <a href="https://kuskon.com/en/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Can Kuskon 3DStudios</a></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Color</strong></p>
<p>Marmorio, Sabbia, Grafite</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Thickness</strong></p>
<p>4 mm</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>End date</strong></p>
<p>2026</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" ></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Known for its elegant boutiques, shopping malls, and gourmet restaurants, Bağdat Caddesi stands out as one of Istanbul's most exclusive areas. For this reason, the avenue is increasingly populated with luxury buildings such as Prenses Palas, recently constructed. But how to differentiate them from the rest? For Gülseren Nur Özçakir from Reneva Group and Can Kuskon 3DStudios, the answer was clear: focusing on a solid, harmonious, and modern presence.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>“Faced with the increasing homogenization of façades on Bağdat Street, we aimed to create a timeless architectural identity, far from ostentation, defined by the quality of materials and attention to detail,” they explain from the studio.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>“The horizontal composition of the volumes, the spacious balconies, and the recessed surfaces gave the complex a balanced silhouette. The Dekton Marmorio, Dekton Sabbia, and Dekton Grafite colors chosen for the façade enhanced the character of the design by contemporarily reinterpreting the look of natural stone,” they continue.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-23.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133161-1379373540]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-23-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Prenses Palas (23)" title="Prenses Palas (23)" /></a></li>
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-14.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133161-1379373540]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-14-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Prenses Palas (14)" title="Prenses Palas (14)" /></a></li>
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133161-1379373540]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-5-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Prenses Palas (5)" title="Prenses Palas (5)" /></a></li>
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-12.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133161-1379373540]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-12-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Prenses Palas (12)" title="Prenses Palas (12)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1649&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133161-3561703858]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-2-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Prenses Palas (2)" title="Prenses Palas (2)" /></a></li>
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-8.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1649&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133161-3561703858]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-8-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Prenses Palas (8)" title="Prenses Palas (8)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-13.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1649&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133161-3027680553]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Prenses-Palas-13-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Prenses Palas (13)" title="Prenses Palas (13)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">Three shades to establish the rhythm of the buildings</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Using colors from Pietra Kode, a collection designed by Daniel Germani that reinterprets the essence of classic Vicenza stone, the studio created a clear envelope featuring Dekton Marmorio and Dekton Sabbia, with Dekton Grafite introducing dark bands running horizontally along the structure, framing certain openings, and emphasizing the separation between floors. This alternation of tones creates rhythm across the two buildings in the residential complex, resulting in a design that is both contrasted and cohesive.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Given that the façade is one of the design's most distinctive elements, the choice of material and colors was deliberate. “Our goal was to create a simple and timeless architectural expression that contributes to the identity of the street where it is located. In this context, we did not view Dekton merely as a cladding material, but as an important component to enhance the character of the space,” the creators explain.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The achieved contemporary aesthetic was also made possible by the large Dekton slabs, which minimize the need for joints and provide the unified and continuous appearance the studio was striving for.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
