<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">Maximum durability near the sea</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The proximity to the coast and constant exposure of the building façades led the studio to highly value Dekton slabs' resistance to UV rays, temperature fluctuations, and the specific humidity and salinity conditions caused by proximity to the sea. It was also crucial that the surface retained its color over time and required minimal maintenance.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>All these needs were met with Dekton, an ultra-compact surface that remains unaffected by ultraviolet radiation, extreme weather conditions, abrasion, and stains. Additionally, its low porosity facilitates cleaning and prevents graffiti from adhering, ensuring a long lifespan for the Prenses Palas façade. As an added benefit, Dekton comes with a 25-year warranty for façade applications and is also a carbon-neutral product throughout its lifecycle.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
