										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="640" height="480" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/IMG_9888.jpeg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image wp-post-image" alt="Image 65 of IMG 9888.jpeg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in Wish Kitchens and Baths - Cosentino" style="margin-bottom:20px;max-width:100%;height:auto" title="Image of IMG 9888.jpeg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 - Cosentino"></p>
