<div class="text">
<div class="row mx-0 mr-lg-5">
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">Mark Wishnow is the owner of Wish Kitchens and Baths, a full-service showroom based in Hagerstown, MD. With over two decades of industry experience, he has built his business on strong relationships and a commitment to delivering end-to-end solutions with best-in-class customer service.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">Under his leadership, the company has earned a reputation for balancing personalized service with high-performance materials to bring each client’s vision to life.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="d-tablet-none col-md-6 px-0">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc" class="core-slider keen-slider">
