<div class="article-wrapper">
<section class="bg-section section-general-use-texto-imagen">
<div class="imagen-texto derecha-izquierda">
<div class="left col-12 col-md-6">
<h2 class="font-40 font-light text-uppercase">Finding my calling in the kitchen and bath industry</h2>
<div class="px-0 d-none d-tablet col-12">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile" class="core-slider keen-slider">
<div class=" core-slider__slide keen-slider__slide number-slide-0" data-id="" data-src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Wish-KB.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&ixlib=php-3.3.0" >
                                                <img decoding="async" class="core-slider__slide__image" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Wish-KB.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" alt="Image 53 of Wish KB.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in Wish Kitchens and Baths - Cosentino" title="Image of Wish KB.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 - Cosentino"></p>
<div class="core-slider__slide__filter"></div>
<div class="core-slider__slide__card-body">
<div class="core-slider__slide__card-body__block"></div>
<div class="core-slider__slide__card-body__block">
<div class="core-slider__slide__card-body__arrow"></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<p>    <script type="text/javascript">
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
            const options = {
                id: "8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile",
                sliderSelector: "#slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile",
                navigationSelector: "#slider-nav-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile",
                dotsSelector: "#slider-dots-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile",
                numItems: 1,
                numItemsTablet: 1,
                numItemsMobile: 1,
                hasLightshow: false,
                hasModal: false,
                loop: false,
                ajaxUrl: "https://www.cosentino.com/usa/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?action=get_slider_modal_info"
            };</p>
<p>            const sliderName = 'slider_' + '8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile';
            window[sliderName] = new SliderHorizontal(options);
        });
    </script>
</div>
</p></div>
<div class="text">
<div class="row mx-0 mr-lg-5">
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">I began my career at Lowe’s and never expected to end up in the kitchen and bath space, but as often happens, I fell into it and quickly found my stride. I became one of the top salespeople in the company and, over 16 years, built a strong commercial and referral business. That experience gave me the confidence to take the next step and start my own company.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">I founded Wish Kitchens and Baths in 2008, right as the market was crashing. It was a challenging time to launch a business, but even through that uncertainty, we were able to grow. Today, nearly 20 years later, the business is still thriving. Relationships have been at the core of my growth. I’m not originally from the area, so building trust within the community was huge. I was fortunate to have great people support me early on, and over time, we’ve built a reputation for delivering strong service and going above and beyond for our clients. Being adaptable and truly taking care of every aspect of a project has been key to sustaining that growth.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="d-tablet-none col-md-6 px-0">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc" class="core-slider keen-slider">
<div class=" core-slider__slide keen-slider__slide number-slide-0" data-id="" data-src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Wish-KB.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&ixlib=php-3.3.0" >
