                navigationSelector: "#slider-nav-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile",
                dotsSelector: "#slider-dots-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile",
                numItems: 1,
                numItemsTablet: 1,
                numItemsMobile: 1,
                hasLightshow: false,
                hasModal: false,
                loop: false,
                ajaxUrl: "https://www.cosentino.com/usa/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?action=get_slider_modal_info"
            };</p>
<p>            const sliderName = 'slider_' + '8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile';
            window[sliderName] = new SliderHorizontal(options);
        });
    </script>
</div>
</p></div>
<div class="text">
<div class="row mx-0 mr-lg-5">
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">The transition from employee to entrepreneur is a major shift. As a business owner, you wear many hats and face challenges you can’t always anticipate. Early on, I stayed focused on what I believed would make the biggest difference: hiring the best designers, working with the best installers, and offering high-quality products that support long-term growth. That focus helped lay a strong foundation for the business.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">For me, it has always been about building meaningful relationships. That philosophy drives how we operate. We aim to provide the best possible products at the right price point, paired with best-in-class service. We take a holistic approach to every project, managing everything from cabinetry to countertops, hardware, and tile. We take time to understand our clients and turn their wants into a reality, whether it’s a simple bathroom update, a full kitchen remodel, or a countertop project. By offering a full-service experience - from design to installation - we’re able to simplify the process for our clients and ensure consistent results.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="d-tablet-none col-md-6 px-0">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc" class="core-slider keen-slider">
