<div class="text">
<div class="row mx-0 mr-lg-5">
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">Balancing design goals with practical considerations is one of the most challenging parts of the job. Not every client is upfront about their budget, so part of our role is helping them understand price points and available options. We don’t just present the most expensive solution; we make sure there’s something for everyone.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">By offering alternatives, we give clients the flexibility to decide where to invest and where to scale back. That way, they can achieve the overall result they’re looking for without feeling overwhelmed. We work with a wide range of clients across different markets, from more budget-conscious homeowners to those looking for high-end customized solutions. The key is listening and guiding them towards choices that align with their vision, budget, and timeline.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="d-tablet-none col-md-6 px-0">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc" class="core-slider keen-slider">
<div class=" core-slider__slide keen-slider__slide number-slide-0" data-id="" data-src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/IMG_4875.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&ixlib=php-3.3.0" >
