</p></div>
<div class="text">
<div class="row mx-0 mr-lg-5">
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">I’ve been working with Cosentino for many years. Through our partnerships, we’re able to purchase and stock material in a way that allows us to stay competitive while still offering premium products. When I speak with clients, I explain that while many surfaces may look similar at first glance, the quality behind Cosentino truly sets them apart. It’s not just about looks; it’s about manufacturing, innovation, and performance. I want my clients to feel confident that they’re investing in something that will last and that they’ll be proud to have in their home.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">An impactful design starts with strong design and layout. We focus on creating a thoughtful plan that reflects how the client wants to live and use the space. From there, material selection becomes critical. Using those high-quality materials, like Cosentino, makes all the difference.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="d-tablet-none col-md-6 px-0">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc" class="core-slider keen-slider">
