<div class="left col-12 col-md-6">
<h2 class="font-40 font-light text-uppercase">Our decades-long relationship with Cosentino</h2>
<div class="px-0 d-none d-tablet col-12">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc_mobile" class="core-slider keen-slider">
