</p></div>
<div class="text">
<div class="row mx-0 mr-lg-5">
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">The level of support we receive from Cosentino is outstanding. Our Retail Sales Managers have always been incredibly responsive and knowledgeable, and that makes a big difference for our clients and us. My design team appreciates how easy it is to get answers quickly, which keeps projects flowing efficiently. The training, product knowledge, and overall support have been a valuable asset to our business.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">What stands out the most is the consistency of the relationship. We’ve built a strong partnership over the years and have always been able to rely on the quality of the products and support behind the team. Beyond day-to-day business, experiences like attending KBIS, seeing innovations, and connecting with the broader Cosentino team add another layer to the partnership. It creates a sense of excitement and gives our team something to strive toward as we continue to grow.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="d-tablet-none col-md-6 px-0">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc" class="core-slider keen-slider">
