		<item>
		<title>{{A contemporary lobby built from layers and contrasts}}</title>
		<link>https://www.cosentino.com/usa/blog/a-contemporary-lobby-built-from-layers-and-contrasts/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[sarabarragan]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:05:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[{{Blog & Events}}]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Bathroom]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Cladding]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Countertop]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Dekton]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Flooring]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cosentino.com/usa/?p=133157</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[The Allied Cities office tower welcomes its users with a high-ceilinged lobby, developed parallel to the building's glazed façade. Inside, Setter Architects organises the entrance with a composition alternating light surfaces with large dark-toned panels. The reception occupies the centre of this space and takes the form of a piece constructed with displaced horizontal volumes, while the access turnstiles are concentrated next to the black slatted wall.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="2000" height="1333" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-16.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image wp-post-image" alt="Image 81 of Big Glilot 16.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in {{A contemporary lobby built from layers and contrasts}} - Cosentino" style="margin-bottom:20px;max-width:100%;height:auto" title="Image of Big Glilot 16.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 - Cosentino"></p>
<div class="wpb-content-wrapper">
<section style="position: relative; background:#ffffff" data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section vc_custom_1596523778098 cos-section">
<div class='cos-cut-background cos-cut-height-11-12' style='background-color: #d9dedf'></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper "></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-l">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p class="mb-4">Case Study</p>
<h1><strong>A contemporary lobby built from layers and contrasts</strong></h1>
<p>Setter Architects</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center">
<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-16-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Big Glilot (16)" title="Big Glilot (16)" /></div>
</figure></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section mt-xl mb-xl">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-none pb-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Location</strong></p>
<p>Israel</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Developer</strong></p>
<p>BIG, Allied</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Color</strong></p>
<p>Kovik, Eter, Lunar, Marmorio</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Thickness</strong></p>
<p>8 mm</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Photography</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://www.shaigil.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Shai Gil</a></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid pt-4 mt-none pt-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Architecture/Design </strong></p>
<p>Michael Michi Setter, <a href="https://setter.co.il/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Setter Architects</a></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Material </strong></p>
<p>Dekton </p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Aplication</strong></p>
<p>Cladding, flooring, recepcion desk</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>End date</strong></p>
<p>2025</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" ></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The Allied Cities office tower welcomes its users with a high-ceilinged lobby, developed parallel to the building's glazed façade. Inside, Setter Architects organises the entrance with a composition alternating light surfaces with large dark-toned panels. The reception occupies the centre of this space and takes the form of a piece constructed with displaced horizontal volumes, while the access turnstiles are concentrated next to the black slatted wall.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The commission included the public areas of the building, both the main lobby and the common spaces on the upper floors. Developers BIG and Allied asked Michael Michi Setter for “a design inspired by the world of high technology.” Setter Architects frequently works on offices for tech companies and professional firms, adapting each project's concept to the client's profile. In Glilot, this approach is reflected in the scale of the spaces and a palette that combines different materials.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=733&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133157-2057968624]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-1-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Big Glilot (1)" title="Big Glilot (1)" /></a></li>
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-4.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=733&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133157-2057968624]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-4-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Big Glilot (4)" title="Big Glilot (4)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-3.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1650&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133157-1065150091]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-3-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Big Glilot (3)" title="Big Glilot (3)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1650&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133157-518222426]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-5-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Big Glilot (5)" title="Big Glilot (5)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">A layered reception</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The main counter features several rectangular-section pieces that overlap and shift, creating different heights for public service. The cladding was done with Dekton Marmorio, an ultra-compact surface with a light background whose pattern realistically recreates travertine. Its horizontal veining complements the arrangement of the volumes and reinforces the stratified reading of the furniture. Small metal profiles run along the joints between some pieces, introducing a fine line into the composition. The use of Dekton Marmorio in the reception is explicitly linked to the main lobby on the ground floor.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Beneath this piece lies flooring made with 8 mm Dekton iD slabs, specifically printed for the project with a pattern that recreates the look of Palladiana terrazzo made of cast stone. The modulation consists of small rectangular shapes on a light grey base and accompanies the entire entrance path. The customised printing allowed for a unique design for the building, transferring it to a surface subjected to the continuous traffic of an office tower.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The selection of materials required “choosing materials that precisely fit the design concept,” explains Michael Michi Setter, while also maintaining the quality needed for a high-traffic space. Ease of maintenance was part of the conditions set by the developers.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-17.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=733&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133157-183860568]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-17-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Big Glilot (17)" title="Big Glilot (17)" /></a></li>
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-7.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=733&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133157-183860568]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-7-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Big Glilot (7)" title="Big Glilot (7)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-6.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1650&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133157-1164965914]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-6-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Big Glilot (6)" title="Big Glilot (6)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1650&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133157-259907535]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Big-Glilot-2-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Big Glilot (2)" title="Big Glilot (2)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">A consistent language throughout all floors</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The work continues in the vertical communication cores. Dekton Kovik clads the walls of the lift area on the ground floor and also appears in the lobbies of the upper floors, where it is used on walls and floors. Its finish recreates the look of concrete with a light tone and subtle variations, used to create large continuous planes around the metal doors. Meanwhile, the lift doors feature Dekton Eter on all floors. Its dark surface, traversed by fine veining, occupies the vertical strip above each access point and marks the position of the cabins within the Dekton Kovik cladding.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>In the restrooms, Dekton Lunar covers the vertical walls, and on the main mirror wall, there is a grooved pattern specifically designed for the project. The vertical incisions introduce relief behind the reflective pieces and alter the way the overhead lighting interacts with the cladding. Opposite this, the communal sink features three integrated basins within a white worktop supported by a suspended wooden cabinet.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Setter particularly values the customisation capabilities offered by the surfaces used. According to the architect, Cosentino products provided “creative freedom to develop bespoke elements,” a quality that enabled the design of the printed lobby flooring and several pieces specifically created for the building. He also highlights the variety of available finishes and the ease of installation on-site.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
