		<item>
		<title>{{A home conceived as a whole, from the façade to the washbasin}}</title>
		<link>https://www.cosentino.com/usa/blog/a-home-conceived-as-a-whole-from-the-facade-to-the-washbasin/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[sarabarragan]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:01:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[{{Blog & Events}}]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Bathroom]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Cladding]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Countertop]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Dekton]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Facade]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Flooring]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Furniture]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Kitchen]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Outdoor]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cosentino.com/usa/?p=133078</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Homes that work at first glance are those where materials become the guiding thread of the entire architecture. This penthouse designed by Rami Kopty, founder of Kopty Architects, is a perfect example. The residence, conceived for the Garrous family, occupies the top floor of the building and is complemented by a terrace of approximately 320 square metres and a private swimming pool. However, its true uniqueness lies in the intention to create a single architectural language capable of extending from the exterior envelope to the smallest interior detail.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="2000" height="1333" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Luxury-penthouse-Kopty-Architecture-26.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image wp-post-image" alt="Image 97 of Luxury penthouse Kopty Architecture 26.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in {{A home conceived as a whole, from the façade to the washbasin}} - Cosentino" style="margin-bottom:20px;max-width:100%;height:auto" title="Image of Luxury penthouse Kopty Architecture 26.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 - Cosentino"></p>
<div class="wpb-content-wrapper">
<section style="position: relative; background:#ffffff" data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section vc_custom_1596523778098 cos-section">
<div class='cos-cut-background cos-cut-height-11-12' style='background-color: #d9dedf'></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper "></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-l">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p class="mb-4">Top Homes</p>
<h1><strong>A home conceived as a whole, from the façade to the washbasin</strong></h1>
<p>Kopty Architects &amp; Engineers</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center">
<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Luxury-penthouse-Kopty-Architecture-26-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Luxury penthouse Kopty Architecture (26)" title="Luxury penthouse Kopty Architecture (26)" /></div>
</figure></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section mt-xl mb-xl">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-none pb-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Location</strong></p>
<p>Israel</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Material </strong></p>
<p>Dekton </p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Aplication</strong></p>
<p>Floors, cladding, kitchen island, worktop, ventilated façade (DKC), swimming pool, washbasin, TV unit</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Photography</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/oren_sonego/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Oren Sonego</a></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid pt-4 mt-none pt-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Architecture/Design </strong></p>
<p><a href="https://www.koptyarchitects.com/home" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Kopty Architects &amp; Engineers</a></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Color</strong></p>
<p>Helena, Sabbia, Sirius, Blanc Concrete, Danae, Marmorio, Albarium, Grigio</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>End date</strong></p>
<p>2026</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" ></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Homes that work at first glance are those where materials become the guiding thread of the entire architecture. This penthouse designed by Rami Kopty, founder of Kopty Architects, is a perfect example. The residence, conceived for the Garrous family, occupies the top floor of the building and is complemented by a terrace of approximately 320 square metres and a private swimming pool. However, its true uniqueness lies in the intention to create a single architectural language capable of extending from the exterior envelope to the smallest interior detail.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The path to achieving this was not easy. During the construction, the studio made key decisions. “We sought to expand the interior spaces while modifying the ceiling heights, which required significant design revisions under great time pressure,” recalls Kopty.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The owners were looking for a contemporary home with clean lines that conveyed a warm and welcoming feeling without compromising its minimalist character. Additionally, as a family accustomed to hosting guests, the project needed to offer spacious and flexible areas capable of adapting to different ways of sharing the home.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
