<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">A single material to build an entire architecture</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Continuity is one of the ideas that best defines the project. Even before designing the interior of the penthouse, Kopty Architects had already developed the building's architecture, including the façades and common lobbies. This circumstance led the studio to propose a unified material strategy for the entire complex.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>“My relationship with Cosentino began by using their materials on the building's façade. The beauty of the result inspired me to bring that same language into the interior of the penthouse, not only through the materials and colour palette but also through clean architectural lines,” explains the architect.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The project incorporates Dekton on virtually every scale. The ventilated façade and pool cladding combine Dekton Sirius, Dekton Blanc Concrete, and Dekton Danae, while Dekton Helena spans the flooring throughout the residence and the walls of the guest bathroom. The kitchen uses Dekton Sabbia for both the island and the worktops, a finish that reappears in the flooring and integrated washbasin of the main bathroom, where it interacts with the vertical cladding of Dekton Marmorio. The latter is also used on the TV wall in the living room and the headboard of the master bedroom. The children's bathrooms, meanwhile, combine walls clad in Dekton Albarium with floors and washbasins made of Dekton Grigio.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
