</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">Continuity as a project philosophy</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>“I wanted to create a continuous design where everything was made from the same material, from the kitchen surfaces to the bathroom washbasins,” says Kopty. This decision was driven by both aesthetic and technical considerations. “The extraordinary durability of the material and the consistency of its colours and finishes create a refined and cohesive aesthetic that enhances the luxurious atmosphere of the entire residence,” notes the architect.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Kopty acknowledges that Dekton is the material that appears most frequently in his projects and claims to have been one of the first architects in Israel to systematically incorporate this large-format ultracompact surface. His interest in modern architecture —particularly international rationalism and the work of Mies van der Rohe— partly explains this pursuit of precision, continuity, and material honesty.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Looking to the future, the architect believes that architecture will evolve towards increasingly flexible spaces capable of adapting to different ways of living, relying on durable materials that extend the lifespan of buildings. “There is no longer room for design concepts that cannot withstand the test of time,” he concludes.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
