<div class="text">
<div class="row mx-0 mr-lg-5">
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">Innovation is in Kitchen & Bath Galleries’ DNA. The company was founded in 1997 after a merger between TCR Cabinets and Crenshaw Appliance Company, fusing cabinetry and appliances under one roof. This concept might be commonplace today, but at the time, it was completely revolutionary.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">Their vision was to create a one-stop shop for clients where all their home renovation needs would be handled with personalization and care. Today, the company has four showrooms in eastern North Carolina and continues to set the standard in kitchen and bath design.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="d-tablet-none col-md-6 px-0">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc" class="core-slider keen-slider">
