    </script>
</div>
</p></div>
<div class="text">
<div class="row mx-0 mr-lg-5">
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">The concept of Kitchen & Bath Galleries is cutting-edge in and of itself. The company was born from a merger between an appliance and a cabinetry company. The visionary founders had an idea to create a full-service kitchen and bath destination, bringing together cabinetry, appliances, surfaces, and hardware under one roof, led by a team of skilled designers. From initial design to coordination, execution, and installation, their team of expert designers handles every detail to ensure the project is completed to perfection.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="paragraf px-0 col-lg-6">
<p class="font-15 font-light">The company is known as a full-service design destination, bringing together a myriad of services under one roof. The goal is to offer a completely personalized service, tailoring our approach to the client&#039;s project needs. As designer Michelle Verill shared, every project kicks off in the client’s home, where they discuss the project and measure the spaces. Afterwards, she goes back to the office to work on design proposals, allowing the client to visualize what their space will look like. After that, it’s off to the races: from material selection to on-site installation, the team is present every step of the way.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="d-tablet-none col-md-6 px-0">
<div id="slider-8414156a-84cf-49c7-9fa5-c423ce4b55bc" class="core-slider keen-slider">
<div class=" core-slider__slide keen-slider__slide number-slide-0" data-id="" data-src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/KB-Galleries-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&ixlib=php-3.3.0" >
