<p class="font-15 font-light">K&B Galleries is a Premium account on WeProfessionals, of which Michelle is an avid user. “It’s super easy to order samples on the platform,” she shared. They stockpile small samples of popular colors for their clients, which is super helpful when selecting other elements such as tile, paint, and appliances. “The rewards are pretty nice too, of course,” she shares.</p>
