                </div>
<div class="core-gallery__content__item__image" gtm-label="gallery_image_image-16" data-src="https://assetstools.cosentino.com/api/v1/bynder/image/706099D8-CDE4-4678-A6043C460DC661A9/cary-kitchen-remodel-2019.jpg?auto=format?&#038;q=80&#038;fit=crop" data-sub-html="&lt;a target=&#039;_blank&#039; href=&#039;https://www.cosentino.com/usa/inspiration/projects/cary-kitchen-remodel-2019&#039;&gt;Cary Kitchen Remodel - 2019&lt;/a&gt;">
