		<item>
		<title>{{Designer Patricia Urquiola transforms the bathroom into an exercise in everyday architecture}}</title>
		<link>https://www.cosentino.com/usa/blog/designer-patricia-urquiola-transforms-the-bathroom-into-an-exercise-in-everyday-architecture/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[sarabarragan]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 10:53:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[{{Blog & Events}}]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Bathroom]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Countertop]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Silestone]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cosentino.com/usa/?p=133073</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Patricia Urquiola is one of those versatile designers capable of transforming an everyday object into a small piece of architecture. She has been doing so for years, and her new Balcoon collection for Duravit proves it once again. Far from perceiving the bathroom as a sum of independent elements, she proposes a system where volumes, materials, and proportions interact to create a coherent, serene, and highly contemporary space.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="2000" height="1378" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image wp-post-image" alt="Image 126 of Duravit Balcoon Patricia Urquiola 2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in {{Designer Patricia Urquiola transforms the bathroom into an exercise in everyday architecture}} - Cosentino" style="margin-bottom:20px;max-width:100%;height:auto" title="Image of Duravit Balcoon Patricia Urquiola 2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 - Cosentino"></p>
<div class="wpb-content-wrapper">
<section style="position: relative; background:#ffffff" data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section vc_custom_1596523778098 cos-section">
<div class='cos-cut-background cos-cut-height-11-12' style='background-color: #d9dedf'></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper "></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-l">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p class="mb-4">Case Study</p>
<h1><strong>Designer Patricia Urquiola transforms the bathroom into an exercise in everyday architecture</strong></h1>
<p>Patricia Urquiola</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center">
<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-2-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-(2)" title="Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-(2)" /></div>
</figure></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section mt-xl mb-xl">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-none pb-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Location</strong></p>
<p>Germany</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>brand</strong></p>
<p>Duravit</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Color</strong></p>
<p>Cinder Craze, Brass Relish, Concrete Pulse</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>End date</strong></p>
<p>2026</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid pt-4 mt-none pt-none">
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Architecture/Design </strong></p>
<p><a href="https://patriciaurquiola.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Patricia Urquiola</a></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Material </strong></p>
<p>Silestone </p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p><strong>Aplication</strong></p>
<p>Worktop, splashback</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="pt-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" ></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Patricia Urquiola is one of those versatile designers capable of transforming an everyday object into a small piece of architecture. She has been doing so for years, and her new Balcoon collection for Duravit proves it once again. Far from perceiving the bathroom as a sum of independent elements, she proposes a system where volumes, materials, and proportions interact to create a coherent, serene, and highly contemporary space.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>Recognised with a German Design Award, the collection takes its name from a play of levels, overhangs, and overlaps that consistently appear in each piece. From basins to bathtubs, including furniture, everything follows the same formal logic inspired by architecture.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>One of the most distinctive elements of the project is the washbasin furniture. The console with an integrated splashback creates visual continuity with the wall, turning a typically secondary piece into the true protagonist. On it rest round or oval basins supported by a square base, a composition that provides sculptural presence without losing functionality.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-6.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=860&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133073-1529215687]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-6-1110x740.jpg" width="1110" height="740" alt="Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-(6)" title="Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-(6)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-4.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1557&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133073-4028790517]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-4-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-(4)" title="Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-(4)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
<ul class="slides">
<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1652&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133073-1169753847]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-1-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-(1)" title="Duravit-Balcoon-Patricia-Urquiola-(1)" /></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">Dialogue between materials</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The collection is built on a warm palette that avoids the traditional clinical white of bathrooms. Ceramics can be chosen in glossy white, satin white, or Clay Terra Matt, a terracotta tone specifically developed for the collection that offers an almost handcrafted appearance. This is complemented by furniture in nature-inspired colours, such as ivory or sand, and ribbed fronts that add texture.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>In this dialogue between materials, Cosentino surfaces play a fundamental role. Duravit incorporates Silestone for the worktops and splashbacks of the consoles in three finishes from the Urban Crush collection: Cinder Craze, Brass Relish, and Concrete Pulse. Inspired respectively by light concrete, coppery sandstone, and dark stone.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p>The presence of Silestone is not solely an aesthetic choice. The hybrid mineral surface provides a highly expressive texture while offering features particularly suited to a space subject to constant use, such as the bathroom. Its non-porous composition facilitates daily cleaning and enhances hygiene, while its resistance to stains and scratches ensures the surface retains its appearance for years. Additionally, it comes with a 25-year warranty and is manufactured using at least 20% recycled materials, employing a production process based on 99% recycled water and electricity from renewable sources.</p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mb-3 mb-none">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
