<li><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Lighthouse-Liverpool-19.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=1650&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-133071-4138541643]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" class="" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Lighthouse-Liverpool-19-540x810.jpg" width="540" height="810" alt="Lighthouse Liverpool (19)" title="Lighthouse Liverpool (19)" /></a></li>
</ul>
