			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Betsy Bardi</title>
		<link>https://www.cosentino.com/usa/blog/betsy-bardi/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[rleon]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:40:53 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[{{Blog & Events}}]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Dekton]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cosentino.com/usa/?p=132814</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/Betsy-Bardi.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image wp-post-image" alt="Image 155 of Betsy Bardi.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in Betsy Bardi - Cosentino" style="margin-bottom:20px;max-width:100%;height:auto" title="Image of Betsy Bardi.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 - Cosentino"></p>
<div class="wpb-content-wrapper">
<section style="position: relative; background:#ffffff" data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-section">
<div class='cos-cut-background cos-cut-height-5-6' style='background-color: #F2F2F2'></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section -6a82b9d76c789 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid cos_author-header vc_row-o-content-middle vc_row-flex">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-5">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<p>C·Top Design</p>
<h1>Betsy Bardi</h1>
<h4>Interior Designer</h4>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-7">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="1707" height="2560" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/250822_1045_11zon-scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="Image 144 of 250822 1045 11zon scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in Betsy Bardi - Cosentino" title="250822_1045_11zon"></div>
</figure></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mt-l mb-l">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid">
<div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-offset-2 vc_col-lg-8">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="cosTestimonial testimonial mb-4 text-center ">
<blockquote class="blockquote"><p>
        “I’ve never been someone who enjoys limitations; I like to dream big, and starting my own firm gave me the freedom to do just that.”    </p></blockquote>
<h3 class="testimonialsName"></h3>
<p class="testimonialsPosition">
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<p style="text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: 400">Betsy Bardi has always been driven by the belief that limitations should never confine great design. Her desire for creative freedom and dreaming big moved her to create </span><a href="https://www.bardidesigns.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span style="font-weight: 400"><span style="text-decoration: underline"><strong>Bardi Designs</strong></span></span></a><span style="font-weight: 400">, a luxury turnkey interior design firm based in Raleigh, North Carolina, with projects nationwide.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: 400">Bardi leads a collaborative team known for delivering thoughtful, highly customized homes that reflect how clients truly live. Let's get started.</span></p>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="mb-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_right">
<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="1708" height="2560" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_020_11zon-scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="Image 145 of 260501 020 11zon scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in Betsy Bardi - Cosentino" title="260501_020_11zon"></div>
</figure></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h2  class="h3" style="color:; text-align:">My mother encouraged creative freedom</h2>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">I knew from a young age that I was creative. When I was about ten years old, I told my mom I wanted to paint a sunflower mural on my bedroom wall. Sunflowers were all the rage at the time, and she said yes. That moment really stuck with me. My mother always allowed me creative freedom, and that encouragement became a through line in how I approach design even today.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h2  class="h3" style="color:; text-align:"></h2>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">In school, I also took some home economics classes and learned to sew my own drapery. I remember making them for my room and putting them up myself. But that experience helped me realize something about myself pretty quickly: I enjoyed specifying and envisioning the design more than I enjoyed making the product. That early exploration helped me understand the part of the process that excited me the most.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h2  class="h3" style="color:; text-align:">Starting Bardi Designs gave me the freedom to dream big</h2>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">Throughout my career, I’ve been fortunate to work across many areas of the industry, from showrooms and design centers to private firms and retail. I learned a tremendous amount in those environments, but I often felt limited by having to work within the confines of someone else’s frameworks or rules. I’ve never been someone who enjoys limitations; I like to dream big, and starting my own firm gave me the freedom to do just that.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h2  class="h3" style="color:; text-align:"></h2>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">I launched Bardi Designs in the Washington, D.C. market for the first couple of years before relocating to Raleigh, where we’ve now been working for over 14 years. I’ve been in the industry for over two decades, ever since graduating from college, and I still wake up every day excited to do what I love.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h2  class="h3" style="color:; text-align:">Learning the business of design</h2>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">The biggest shift from working for someone to launching my business has been learning what I call the ‘business of design.’ It’s something they don’t teach you in school. You learn by doing, and candidly, I’m still learning every day. As a design leader, I need to understand how creative decisions affect the bottom line. At the same time, I have to manage a team and the dynamics that come with it, so both my design vision and theirs can come to life for our clients. Collaboration has become a huge part of our culture at Bardi Designs. Earlier in my career, I worked in siloed environments where I was responsible for everything myself. Learning to let go, trust my team, and collaborate was a personal evolution for me.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">A tried and true collaborative approach</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">To support collaboration, we developed a structured internal process that keeps us aligned. It took time to refine, and we continue to adjust it as we learn and grow, but having those guidelines has been incredibly helpful for the business. Every project begins with an intake form and discovery call to understand who the client is, how they live in their space, pain points, and the scope of the project. From there, we hold a kickoff meeting, which is one of my favorite moments because we go from design vision to design solutions. Finally, we move into implementation. Being a turnkey firm is important to us because we handle both the construction and furnishings. That’s where materials like Dekton come into play, which we might specify for the countertops but also incorporate into an outdoor grill or cladding. I love that versatility, and the turnkey model allows us to weave those elements together seamlessly.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="wpb_images_carousel wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div id="vc_images-carousel-1-1786952154" data-ride="vc_carousel" data-wrap="false" style="width: 100%;" data-interval="0" data-auto-height="yes" data-mode="horizontal" data-partial="false" data-per-view="1" data-hide-on-end="true" class="vc_slide vc_images_carousel">
<ol class="vc_carousel-indicators">
<li data-target="#vc_images-carousel-1-1786952154" data-slide-to="0"></li>
<li data-target="#vc_images-carousel-1-1786952154" data-slide-to="1"></li>
<li data-target="#vc_images-carousel-1-1786952154" data-slide-to="2"></li>
</ol>
<div class="vc_carousel-inner">
<div class="vc_carousel-slideline">
<div class="vc_carousel-slideline-inner">
<div class="vc_item">
<div class="vc_inner"><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_006_11zon-scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-132814-1028287724]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" width="2560" height="1709" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_006_11zon-scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full" alt="Image 146 of 260501 006 11zon scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in Betsy Bardi - Cosentino" title="260501_006_11zon"></a></div>
</div>
<div class="vc_item">
<div class="vc_inner"><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_051_11zon-scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-132814-1028287724]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" width="2560" height="1709" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_051_11zon-scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full" alt="Image 147 of 260501 051 11zon scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in Betsy Bardi - Cosentino" title="260501_051_11zon"></a></div>
</div>
<div class="vc_item">
<div class="vc_inner"><a class="" href="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_022_11zon-scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;fit=crop&#038;ixlib=php-3.3.0&#038;max-h=734&#038;max-w=1100" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-132814-1028287724]" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" width="2560" height="1707" src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_022_11zon-scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0" class="attachment-full" alt="Image 148 of 260501 022 11zon scaled.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php 3.3 in Betsy Bardi - Cosentino" title="260501_022_11zon"></a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><a class="vc_left vc_carousel-control" href="#vc_images-carousel-1-1786952154" data-slide="prev"><span class="icon-prev"></span></a><a class="vc_right vc_carousel-control" href="#vc_images-carousel-1-1786952154" data-slide="next"><span class="icon-next"></span></a></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<h6><em>Elevator Lobby | Dekton Soke Countertops | Boston, MA | Photography: Catherine Nguyen</em></h6>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid pb-l">
<div  class="mb-4 wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-offset-0 vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-offset-2 vc_col-md-8">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h2  class="h3" style="color:; text-align:">Design is not a luxury, it’s a necessity</h2>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">More than a luxury, I believe design is a necessity. Your environment touches and affects every facet of your life: mood, lifestyle, and how you move through your day. On some projects, we might design a full home, an entire level, or a major room, but we do our best work when we can take a holistic approach. When we’re able to look at the home as a whole, we can create a natural flow where each space connects to the next and tells a chapter of the same story. That level of thoughtfulness creates environments that support how people actually live, and that’s where design becomes meaningful.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-offset-0 vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-offset-0 vc_col-md-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">Working with the right partners to create customized solutions</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">As I mentioned earlier, having my own firm allows us to customize in every way possible. I recently worked on a project in Boston for a client who loves extremely bespoke design. The more custom, the better. It allowed my creativity to really flow. One of the features we designed was a set of curved shelves with sharknose edges made in Dekton, and they turned out beautifully.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:"></h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">That said, my vision as a designer is only as good as the vendors and fabricators I partner with, and we’re fortunate to have incredible collaborators. One of them is ROCKin'teriors. Laura Grandlienard, who runs the company, is never one to back down from a challenge. Impossible is not in her vocabulary. For those curved shelves, I provided her with a CAD drawing, and she actually prototyped them before installation and brought the sample to the studio. Seeing it in person helped both us and the client visualize the final result. The client was over the moon, and so was I. That kind of collaboration is what allows truly custom design to happen.</div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
