</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_279_11zon-scaled-648x960.jpg" width="648" height="960" alt="260501_279_11zon" title="260501_279_11zon" /></div>
</figure></div>
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<h6><em>Kitchen | Dekton Laos Countertops | Boston, MA | Photography: Catherine Nguyen</em></h6>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://imgix.cosentino.com/usa/wp-content/uploads/260501_242_11zon-1-scaled-648x960.jpg" width="648" height="960" alt="260501_242_11zon" title="260501_242_11zon" /></div>
</figure></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:">TRAVEL IS SEEPED INTO EVERY ASPECT OF MY WORK</h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">Travel has had a huge influence on my design perspective. Interestingly, the first time I ever got on an airplane was when I was 19 years old, which felt late at the time. But that experience opened me to new worlds of ideas, architecture, and design approaches I had never seen before. About ten years later, I married a European, and now we travel frequently. At least once a year, we find ourselves in Europe and eventually purchased a flat in Budapest. The design there is so unique and different from what you typically see in the U.S. It feels exotic and layered in an incredibly inspiring way. </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="" style="color:; text-align:"></h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">
Those experiences influence almost every design decision I make. I love bringing small aspects of those global perspectives back to my projects so clients can see what’s possible, even if they’re not traveling themselves. Travel also reinforces something I strongly believe in: with the right planning and collaboration, almost anything in design can be achieved. </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="wpb_gallery wpb_content_element vc_clearfix wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_gallery_slides wpb_flexslider flexslider_fade flexslider" data-interval="3" data-flex_fx="fade">
