<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<h6><em>Fireplace | Dekton Soke Countertops | Boston, MA | Photography: Catherine Nguyen</em></h6>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="h2" style="color:; text-align:">Crafting an intentional future for my firm </h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">For me, the future is about natural evolution rather than rapid expansion. My goal has never been to grow the firm endlessly; I really love the size we are now. We have a team of seven, and it’s a sweet spot that allows us to collaborate closely while maintaining a supportive environment. </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
<section  data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_section cos-title-subtitle cos-title-subtitle-6a82b9d76be11 vc_section-o-content-middle vc_section-flex">
<div class="container">
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<h3  class="h2" style="color:; text-align:"></h3>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid d-flex justify-content-center">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class=" wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
<div class="wpb_wrapper ">
<div style="color:; text-align:">What has changed over time is the geographic reach of our projects. Many of our clients have second homes, and we’re able to follow them to those locations. We’ve worked on projects in Las Vegas, Indiana, Boston, and Florida, and I expect that trend to continue. It’s exciting for me because I love traveling and bringing our bespoke design approach to different parts of the country for clients who really appreciate it. </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</p></div>
</section>
<div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid">
<div  class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12">
<div class="vc_column-inner">
<div class="wpb_wrapper" style="" >
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
